## Required mobile UX
1. No horizontal text overflow (placeholders must wrap on mobile).
2. Bottom sticky Call/Text/See Models: hidden until user scrolls past hero CTA.
3. When bottom bar is visible, nav sticky CTA = Get Directions (not Call). Never two Call buttons.

